$MDESC::Type = "Defend and Destroy";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Defend and Destroy" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Halcyon II" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Dusk" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> On the planet of Halcyon II both the <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> have established heavily fortified bases.  Both of these Tribes have stolen a prototype bot from the other Tribe and locked it up in a detention center using a forcefield.  To shut down this forcefield you must detroy the POW generators.  Each of these will add two points to your total.  You must destroy five other objectives in order to win!  Releasing the bot early however, will provide a great assistance to your success.";
